-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §33 (part ח, שעון נוכחות): from תשע"ב a
-- teaching employee on the reform's terms, in full or in part, signs in
-- and out at every entry to the school and every exit from it, on a
-- computerised attendance clock to be installed in the school.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `33 שעון נוכחות`

DECLARE `Oz section 33 action` IS ONE OF
    `sign attendance on the school's computerised clock at an entry or an exit`

-- ¶1: from the school year תשע"ב (convention dates.school-year), to the
-- teaching employees employed on the reform's terms, "בין באופן חלקי ובין
-- ביישום מלא".
@ref akn:art_33/p1
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 33 asks attendance signing of a teaching employee in` y e IF
        y AT LEAST `the school year 5772`
    AND NOT e EQUALS `off the Oz reform`

-- ¶1: he signs attendance at each entry to the school and each exit from
-- it, by the computerised clock (no deadline but the entry or exit itself:
-- convention dates.no-deadline). The clock is one "אשר יותקן בבית הספר":
-- the sentence names no one to install it, so the encoding writes no duty
-- to install it (the employers' duty to fit the schools is §34's).
@ref akn:art_33/p1
`signing attendance at an entry or an exit` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `sign attendance on the school's computerised clock at an entry or an exit`

§§ `33 -- illustrations`

#ASSERT `section 33 asks attendance signing of a teaching employee in` `the school year 5772` `the Oz reform in part`
#ASSERT NOT `section 33 asks attendance signing of a teaching employee in` `the school year 5772` `off the Oz reform`
#ASSERT NOT `section 33 asks attendance signing of a teaching employee in` 2010 `the Oz reform in full`
